Description: Provides tools for the design of clinical trials, including 
    randomization and treatment allocation list generation 
    and sample size calculation.
    Supports block randomization with or without stratification, 
    with export formats compatible with Ennov and REDCap. 
    Sample size methods cover superiority and non-inferiority trials 
    with continuous or binary endpoints, cluster randomized trials 
    (including parallel, baseline-period, and stepped-wedge designs), 
    precision-based calculations, and phase II designs based on Fleming's 
    and A'Hern's methods.
